sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Client / Chat UI
    participant Gateway as LiteLLM Gateway (:4000)
    participant Guardrail as Betterleaks Presidio (:8080)
    participant Redis as Redis (Vault AES-256-GCM)
    participant Engine as Local Inference (Ollama)

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions (Prompt with API key)
    Gateway->>Guardrail: Pre-call Inspection (POST /v1/anonymize)
    Guardrail->>Guardrail: Regex & NLP NER PII Analysis
    Guardrail->>Redis: Store Secret Token Mapping (AES-256-GCM encrypted)
    Guardrail-->>Gateway: Anonymized Prompt (Surrogate tokens)
    Gateway->>Engine: Ingest Anonymized Prompt
    Engine-->>Gateway: Raw Model Completion
    Gateway->>Guardrail: Post-call De-anonymize (POST /v1/deanonymize)
    Guardrail->>Redis: Fetch & Decrypt Original Tokens
    Guardrail-->>Gateway: Restored Safe Completion
    Gateway-->>Client: Final Response Stream
